p('dependency_audit.py recursively checks external bytecode reads and runs the extracted original function with only NumPy, itertools, math and the builtins complex, float, max, range and sum. Those eight names are the entire external-read set; no closure state is captured. This confirms the source-specific dependency finding, assuming ordinary unmodified libraries. Targeted AST extraction bypasses unrelated macro imports; this is not a full Stage-3 pipeline rerun.')
