table([['Diagnostic','Recorded result'],['Targeted replay and extended color-audit suite','36 / 36 pass'],['Source-dependency suite','4 / 4 pass'],['Common kernel dimension','1, numerical and exact symbolic'],['Maximum total-generator action','0 in the recorded original run'],['Generator Gram / commutator errors',f"{e['gram_error']:.3e} / {e['commutator_closure_error']:.3e}"],['Collective SU(3) rotation error, 32 trials',f"{e['collective_SU3_rotation_max_error_32_cases']:.3e}"],['Joint-state factorization error',f"{e['projected_joint_state_factorization_error']:.3e}"],['rgb / one-site phase negative-control charge norms','0.707106781 / 0.816496581']])
p('The exact symbolic calculation uses nonzero rescalings of the generators to remove radicals; the common kernel and signed integer singlet vector are checked without numerical tolerance. The joint-state test projects a seeded positive 6-address by 27-color density operator into the exact singlet sector and compares it with the product of its address marginal and the singlet projector. Negative controls violate the color constraint and are detected. Checks overlap and are not independent physical observations.')
p('The exact v0.8.2 manuscript and matching companion package are identified by <link href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23497517" color="blue">https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23497517</link>. RELEASE.json binds the PDF, scripts, source manifest and reference outputs by SHA-256. The scientific scripts, eight frozen original sources and reference outputs are unchanged from the v0.6 package (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23496836). SOURCE_SHA256.json is checked before execution. The upstream source is pinned to commit 9d9daf21154e46e55b9fd0fd461c7c070156ab94.')
