h('Conclusion')
p('The frozen particle/component replay is reproducible and order dependent. Its supplied color test preserves the declared singlet but consumes no arithmetic state, and its exact three-factor singlet sector cannot retain address distinctions. These results specify the information that must be retained when extending this particle/component interface. This is a source-specific reproducibility note and conditional model-development result; general physical completion remains outside its claim.')
